{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2013-meet-science2-14","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2013,"subject":"chemistry","number":14,"points":2,"unitId":"coordination","unitLabel":"배위화학","topic":"착물·리간드","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["coordination","bonding","acid"],"stem":"CO2의 제거에 작용하는 탄산 무수화 효소의 활성화 자리를 모방한\n모델 착물인 [L3CoOH2]2+에 의한 CO2 제거 반응의 메커니즘에서 \n중요한 두 반응 단계는 다음과 같다. L은 중성 한자리 리간드이다.\n단계 Ⅰ: [L3CoOH2]2+(aq) ⇄ [L3CoOH]+(aq)+H +(aq)\n                                     Ka =1.0×10−8\n단계 Ⅱ: \n이에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 고른 것은?\n<보 기>\nㄱ. [L3CoOH]+은 반자기성이다.\nㄴ. pH 7에서 농도는 [L3CoOH2]2+이 [L3CoOH]+보다 크다.\nㄷ. 단계 Ⅱ에서 [L3CoOH]+은 루이스 산이다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02","fig-03","fig-04","fig-05","fig-06"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t012"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t013"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t014"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t015"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t016"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":12,"height":17,"region":0,"bbox":[44.28,11.575,4.8,6.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2013-meet-science2-14/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":307,"height":38,"region":0,"bbox":[76.28,25.975,122.8,15.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t002"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2013-meet-science2-14/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":554,"height":38,"region":0,"bbox":[61.48,72.775,221.6,15.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t004"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2013-meet-science2-14/03.webp"},{"id":"fig-04","width":144,"height":31,"region":0,"bbox":[265.48,95.175,57.6,12.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2013-meet-science2-14/04.webp"},{